#version 430

// The sun's contact shadows, traced in screen space (ContactShadowRenderer, SHADOWS.md): what the shadow map is too coarse and too biased to see,
// a foot on the ground, a stone in the grass, the folds of a body.
//
// A port to GLSL of Bend Studio's screen space shadows, as used in Days Gone (Graham Aldridge, "Screen Space Shadows", SIGGRAPH 2023):
